name: Seaboard BLOCK M: jazz guitar
by: ROLI, "Seaboard BLOCK M: Any instrument is possible. Anywhere." (YouTube sAKCSkkxzRM); written for odo by Claude
about: A short excerpt of ROLI's demo, to learn from: ROLI, "Seaboard BLOCK M: Any instrument is possible. Anywhere." (YouTube sAKCSkkxzRM), 0:26.0 to 1:03.0,
about: played on a Seaboard with Kontakt Jazz Guitar. Music and performance theirs (all rights reserved).
about: Transcribed for odo by machine (Basic Pitch) with each note's own pitch curve (bends, scoops,
about: vibrato) and loudness (pressure) measured from the recording, in free time (one beat a second).
about: On the touch pad, chromatic: the pad: jazz-guitar, pressed lightly (a light press strikes softer: the recording's darker pick).
about: A test of how close a touch screen gets to the Seaboard: listen against the video.
